    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "lang": "fr",
      "dir": "ltr",
      "id": "ex-4",
      "exercise_type": "open",
      "stem": "Une population de bactéries compte $u_0=1000$ individus. Chaque heure, elle est multipliée par $0{,}8$ puis on ajoute $400$ individus : $u_{n+1}=0{,}8u_n+400$.",
      "answer": "$u_1=1200$ ; $v_n=-1000\\times 0{,}8^n$ ; $u_n=2000-1000\\times 0{,}8^n$ ; la population se stabilise vers $2000$.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "$u_1=0{,}8\\times 1000+400=1200$.",
        "$v_{n+1}=u_{n+1}-2000=0{,}8(u_n-2000)=0{,}8v_n$, donc $(v_n)$ est géométrique de raison $0{,}8$ et $v_0=-1000$.",
        "$u_n=v_n+2000=2000-1000\\times 0{,}8^n$.",
        "$0{,}8^n\\to 0$ donc $u_n\\to 2000$ : la population se stabilise vers $2000$ bactéries."
      ],
      "difficulty": "hard",
      "concept_ids": [
        "concept:suite-geometrique"
      ],
      "points": 5,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "prompt": "Calculer $u_1$.",
          "answer": "$u_1=1200$",
          "solution_steps": [
            "$u_1=0{,}8\\times 1000+400=1200$."
          ],
          "points": 0.5,
          "skill": "calculate"
        },
        {
          "label": "2.a",
          "prompt": "On pose $v_n=u_n-2000$. Montrer que $(v_n)$ est géométrique.",
          "answer": "Raison $0{,}8$, $v_0=-1000$.",
          "solution_steps": [
            "$v_{n+1}=0{,}8(u_n-2000)=0{,}8v_n$."
          ],
          "points": 1.5,
          "skill": "prove"
        },
        {
          "label": "2.b",
          "prompt": "En déduire $u_n$ en fonction de $n$.",
          "answer": "$u_n=2000-1000\\times 0{,}8^n$",
          "solution_steps": [
            "$v_n=-1000\\times 0{,}8^n$ donc $u_n=v_n+2000$."
          ],
          "points": 1.5,
          "depends_on": [
            "2.a"
          ],
          "skill": "deduce"
        },
        {
          "label": "3",
          "prompt": "Calculer la limite de $(u_n)$ et interpréter le résultat.",
          "answer": "$2000$ : la population se stabilise.",
          "solution_steps": [
            "$0{,}8^n\\to 0$ donc $u_n\\to 2000$."
          ],
          "points": 1.5,
          "depends_on": [
            "2.b"
          ],
          "skill": "interpret"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
